# Secrets. The `**/` variants are the ones that matter: a bare `.env`
# only matches the context root, so apps/api/.env and, worse,
# apps/api/.env.cloud with live Neon and Upstash credentials were being
# copied into every image. Keep the example, which carries no values.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
